    end

    subgraph IP[摄取与投影面]
        I[Ingestion / Mapping\nStandards·XMI·JSON-LD·外部本体]
        B[Kafka / Redpanda + Outbox\n版本化变更事件]
        X[Projection Reconciler\nhash·checkpoint·lag·rebuild]
        I --> R
        C --> B --> X
    end

    subgraph KP[语义与运营知识面]
        S[RDF / OWL / SHACL Store\nSKOS·PROV-O·GeoSPARQL·OWL-Time]
        G[Operational Object Graph\nObject·Property·Link·State]
        V[Search / Vector Projections\nFTS·embedding·rerank]
        X --> S
        X --> G
        X --> V
    end

    subgraph RP[运行与安全面]
        Q[Semantic Query Gateway\nSPARQL·Graph·SQL·EvidenceBundle]
        P[Dynamic Policy Engine\nobject·property·link·action]
        AS[Object & Action Service\nAction·Function·Interface·SDK]
        S --> Q
        G --> Q
        V --> Q
        Q --> P --> AS
    end

    subgraph DP[业务事实与能力执行面]
        PG[(PostgreSQL / PostGIS\n业务与事务真值)]
        SP[Standards Platform\n标准审定与发布权威]
        CAP[Capability Plane\nSQL·PostGIS·ArcPy·TWM·MCP]
        CR[Cognitive Runtime\nPlanning·Evidence·HITL·Evaluation]
        SP --> I
        PG --> I
        AS --> CAP --> PG
        CR --> Q
        CR --> AS
    end

